    "title": "Amnesty International calls for abolition of ICE for the first time in new report - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alyssa Chen ,\n1 days ago International human rights organization Amnesty International has called for the abolition of U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement in a new report alleging human rights abuses in the Trump administration’s immigration operations. The report focuses on documenting human rights violations in ICE operations in the Twin Cities, Chicago, New Orleans... Read full article",
